# Media: track the initial seed room photos (shipped with the code so
# they survive Render's ephemeral filesystem), but ignore anything an
# admin uploads later through /admin/ — those won't persist on Render's
# free tier anyway (see DEPLOYMENT.md) and don't belong in source control.
media/*
!media/rooms/
media/rooms/*
